{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011tjBzgNK9FoQqGxgDoHWRY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t## Iteration US-216 (Attempt 2) - Mon, Apr 14, 2026\n2\t\n3\tCompleted: Malaysia Online Safety Act 2025 – Add safety reporting mechanism for user-submitted content (ID: US-216)\n4\t\n5\t### What was implemented\n6\t- **ReportContentButton.tsx** - Reusable React client component with:\n7\t  - Accessible report button (aria-label, title attribute)\n8\t  - Modal dialog for reporting harmful content\n9\t  - Pre-filled email (mailto:) link to safety@pelangicapsulehostel.com\n10\t  - Link to Safety Guidelines page within modal\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6e4fba7-5ce6-4787-94af-0cd5cb35d7c6","uuid":"4add0ec5-1a8f-4810-85b9-25a302ebe4a6","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:49:15.216Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\progress.txt","content":"## Iteration US-216 (Attempt 2) - Mon, Apr 14, 2026\n\nCompleted: Malaysia Online Safety Act 2025 – Add safety reporting mechanism for user-submitted content (ID: US-216)\n\n### What was implemented\n- **ReportContentButton.tsx** - Reusable React client component with:\n  - Accessible report button (aria-label, title attribute)\n  - Modal dialog for reporting harmful content\n  - Pre-filled email (mailto:) link to safety@pelangicapsulehostel.com\n  - Link to Safety Guidelines page within modal","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1518}}}
